msgid "I will accept your offer to become allies, %(_player_)s. We will both benefit from this partnership."
msgstr "Я прийму вашу пропозицію про союз,  %(_player_)s. Ми будемо отримувати користь з цього партнерства."

msgid "I will ally with you, %(_player_)s, but only if you send me a tribute of %(_amount_)s %(_resource_)s."
